":\"Yun Juyan\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2726955,\"name\":\"Chang Yuci\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ig26n4CRMXwEcZo6uxz7X9g1Jub.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1368337,\"title\":\"The Odyssey\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5rhTDKUhPYvpdQIijFIs5VoWsON.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c7btGYblBnfAaw713WvFM0Kimc7.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Odysseus, the legendary King of Ithaca, embarks on a long and perilous journey home following the Trojan War. Throughout his voyage, he is forced to confront the whims of gods, mythological monsters, and trials that stretch both his cunning and his humanity to the breaking point.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1153576,\"title\":\"Street Fighter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ccxdepKqORLwccbzvO4eAGkN0IC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zDE9hd1SG9695YncbZGjSf7Z9Jk.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1993, estranged Street Fighters Ryu and Ken Masters are thrown back into combat when the mysterious Chun-Li recruits them for the next World Warrior Tournament: a brutal clash of fists, fate, and fury. But behind this battle royale lies a deadly conspiracy that forces them to face off against each other and the demons of their past. And if they don't, it's GAME OVER!\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":980431,\"title\":\"Avatar Aang: The Last Airbender\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3sgnSfNT27Bx5O5ukr7B26mhEQq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ezbrL1dMymKQZw7mDEWa2ZTzN7d.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Avatar Aang, the world's last Airbender, learns of an ancient power that could save his culture from extinction. With the help of his friends, he embarks on a global quest to find it before it falls into the wrong hands and threatens to upend the peace they sacrificed everything to achieve.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1657630,\"title\":\"The Awakening\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AhP971WogMHbF5iKJPKi6e6oaya.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4pYKqctQvvdyhuGjiK4szH9jEv9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An elite military unit on a mission in the South American jungle encounters a deadly supernatural force revealing an ancient presence that continues to claim anyone who dares enter its domain.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Action\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":120,\"title\":\"The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6oom5QYQ2yQTMJIbnvbkBL9cHo6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oiwc338EoBgS4sEI2ixAny4KQKg.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Young hobbit Frodo Baggins, after inheriting a mysterious ring from his uncle Bilbo, must leave his home in order to keep it from falling into the hands of its evil creator. Along the way, a fellowship is formed to protect the ringbearer and make sure that the ring arrives at its final destination: Mt. Doom, the only place where it can be destroyed.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":453395,\"title\":\"Doctor Strange in the Multiverse of Madness\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ddJcSKbcp4rKZTmuyWaMhuwcfMz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AdyJH8kDm8xT8IKTlgpEC15ny4u.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Doctor Strange, with the help of mystical allies both old and new, traverses the mind-bending and dangerous alternate realities of the Multiverse to confront a mysterious new adversary.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":122917,\"title\":\"The Hobbit: The Battle of the Five Armies\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xT98tLqatZPQApyRmlPL12LtiWp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3UbaCMmqOd7mca4Y5DOzY2ZVTyX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following Smaug's attack on Laketown, Bilbo and the dwarves try to defend Erebor's mountain of treasure from others who claim it: the men of the ruined Laketown and the elves of Mirkwood. Meanwhile an army of Orcs led by Azog the Defiler is marching on Erebor, fueled by the rise of the dark lord Sauron. Dwarves, elves and men must unite, and the hope for Middle-Earth falls into Bilbo's hands.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":566525,\"title\":\"Shang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9f2Q0U3IOsLgrI2HkvldwSABZy5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r7K6Xt0RX4Mw0cAbZVw5cyb1Tux.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Shang-Chi must confront the past he thought he left behind when he is drawn into the web of the mysterious Ten Rings organization.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22,\"title\":\"Pirates of the Caribbean: The Curse of the Black Pearl\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/poHwCZeWzJCShH7tOjg8RIoyjcw.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uRNgkJSkNBFbbn9fPsEjDIy8Sh3.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When wily pirate Captain Barbossa seizes Jack Sparrow’s beloved ship, the Black Pearl, and kidnaps the governor’s daughter, Elizabeth Swann, blacksmith Will Turner reluctantly teams up with the unpredictable pirate Jack to rescue her—only to uncover a terrifying curse that turns Barbossa’s crew into the undead.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":454639,\"title\":\"Masters of the Universe\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oRuyGUHdoaQxWP3SDfafGkStxTC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5MUMB3aPEPEQPCIAaygXFUTWE9Y.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After being separated for 15 years, the Sword of Power leads Prince Adam back to Eternia, where he discovers his home shattered under the fiendish rule of Skeletor. To save his family and his world, Adam must join forces with his closest allies, Teela and Duncan/Man-At-Arms, and embrace his true destiny as He-Man — the most powerful man in the universe.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"MWSO99T6Ld8\",\"name\":\"【FILM】THE LEGEND OF ZU 蜀山降魔传\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}